      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's perfect, that's exactly the kind of detail the artist needs. \n\nI'm thinking of adding a few more characters to round out the \"underworld\" and \"high society\" aspects of the game. To keep the world feeling gritty and realistic, can you give me physical descriptions (ethnicity, skin tone, hair, etc.) for a couple more characters?\n\n1. A person who looks like they're involved in some illegal street activity\n2. A very wealthy socialite attending a gala\n3. A person who works as a security guard at a high-end bank\n4. A person who seems lost or out of place in a rough neighborhood",
